im":[],"m":1272},{"id":"dbrrbd_p51_1273","t":"Hi Tirnanog, Hope you don't mind me giving some feedback. I added few more into the chart.\n\nTirnanog wrote: Hi all,\n\nExcellent site,Thank you!\n\nHere is my first 103.\n\nWould appreciate if anyone could let me know if I'm on the right path.\n\nThanks again.","a":"victoryong","d":"","n":"#1273","p":51,"im":["7ee4d715b8d3983dcfe18f43249d82a81484acbb","0fe69190ca1d75219e3eab4af92fd7eba6529fc7"],"m":1273},{"id":"dbrrbd_p51_1274","t":"Hi Victoryong,\n\nAnything good bad or indifferent that will help me to understand the markets better is extremely welcomed. Thank you very much for your time!\n\nAttached is the balance of the Homework.","a":"Tirnanog","d":"","n":"#1274","p":51,"im":["057784be932b610b4e9fff953c7c352bce5aa905","da0ac924e725e6edec1c3df6ed67fcbd276912ad","62b90da3703646a7bce0d5c5aebe85e9487f2bb4","dfd3b1925403120ce9e11825954fcfd886ec3e09"],"m":1274},{"id":"dbrrbd_p51_1275","t":"Hi Timanog, I'm just sharing what I've learn, you'll have to decide whether it's right or wrong, suitable or not. Btw, you are a fast learner! Here is how I would draw a supply and demand area/zone.\n\n1. Locate where price move 2. Identify one or two candle before price move\n\n3. Draw the zone based on the candle before price move\n\nProvide 3 examples\n\nTirnanog wrote: Hi Victoryong,\n\nAnything good bad or indifferent that will help me to understand the markets better is extremely welcomed. Thank you very much for your time!\n\nAttached is the balance of the Homework.","a":"victoryong","d":"","n":"#1275","p":51,"im":["f52a78a717c905a976fd915a71dcc8384ce8eaff"],"m":1275}],"images":[{"k":"9c4daa16a1e666c4edd06a4ef2ec94596b1768bd","t":"assets/thumbs/9c4daa16a1e666c4edd06a4ef2ec94596b1768bd.webp","f":"assets/images/9c4daa16a1e666c4edd06a4ef2ec94596b1768bd.png","w":1357,"h":630,"b":21857,"o":"9c4daa16a1e666c4edd06a4ef2ec94596b1768bd.png","p":51,"pid":"dbrrbd_p51_1251"},{"k":"d12d783a8b1c17b561549b47405424a10167838e","t":"assets/thumbs/